# Wave W17-O (Route 115): mist turf — spray-fresh shore grass: the brightest green in the tranche, kept wet and vivid by the falls’ breath, with dewy pale flecks standing in it like the spray made grass (design: calm speckled grass along a quiet shore, the falls’ spray at the cave mouth end). Route 115’s own ground — fresher than Route 114’s dusty crater grass behind the cave and split from it by moisture: this grass DRINKS.
